{"habitflow":{"description":"HabitFlow is an offline habit tracker that turns your daily routines into a simple RPG. Track your goals with checkboxes, counters, or a timer, earn XP to level up, and use Day Freezes to keep your streak alive on busy days. There are no accounts or cloud tracking, so all your data stays right on your device.","officialSite":"https://habitflow.adnoryx.eu/","screenshots":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/today.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/today_light.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/routines.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/routines_light.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/insights.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/insights_light.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/trophies.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adnoryx/HabitFlow/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/trophies_light.jpg"]}}